{
  "name": "encoding-switcher",
  "displayName": "编码自动切换器 (GB2312/UTF-8)",
  "description": "自动检测文件编码并以正确编码打开，防止中文乱码；支持 UTF-8 与 GB2312 一键互相切换",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "encoding",
    "GB2312",
    "GBK",
    "UTF-8",
    "乱码",
    "编码",
    "encoding converter"
  ],
  "publisher": "leoy",
  "author": "上了个大笔当",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/2633352305/encoding-switcher.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "email": "2633352305@qq.com"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.75.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "encoding-switcher.saveWithEncoding",
        "title": "选择编码保存",
        "category": "编码切换",
        "icon": "$(file-code)"
      },
      {
        "command": "encoding-switcher.openEncodingView",
        "title": "以正确编码查看",
        "category": "编码切换"
      }
      ],
      "configuration": {
        "title": "编码切换器",
        "properties": {
          "encoding-switcher.applyKernelGuess": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "markdownDescription": "把 `kernelGuessEncodings` 写入**当前工作区**的 `files.candidateGuessEncodings`（限制内核猜码范围）。**默认关闭**：部分内核/版本对候选列表支持不佳，强制写入会导致猜测失效、只回落默认编码"
          },
          "encoding-switcher.detectionEncodings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [
              "gbk",
              "gb18030"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "UTF-8 之外要自动识别/纠正/转换的编码列表（按优先级排序，使用 iconv-lite 支持的编码名，如 `gbk`、`gb18030`、`big5`、`shift_jis`、`cp1252` 等）。命令面板「选择编码保存」与「以正确编码查看」的选项也来自此列表"
          },
          "encoding-switcher.kernelGuessEncodings": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "default": [
              "utf8",
              "gbk",
              "gb18030"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "激活时写入内核 `files.candidateGuessEncodings` 的候选编码。注意：候选中不要包含某编码的子集（如 gbk 之外再放 gb2312），子集编解码会损坏扩展字符"
          }
        }
      },
    "menus": {
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "encoding-switcher.saveWithEncoding",
          "group": "navigation",
          "when": "encoding-switcher:isActive"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run build",
    "build": "node esbuild.js",
    "watch": "node esbuild.js --watch",
    "package": "vsce package"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^18.0.0",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.75.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.19.0",
    "ovsx": "^1.1.1",
    "typescript": "^5.3.0",
    "vsce": "^2.15.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "iconv-lite": "^0.7.3"
  }
}
